{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/poteto/status/2090141955695198633","id":"2090141955695198633","text":"this is a huge release! i shipped 1000 PRs last month and am on track to doubling that this month, all thanks to cloud agents. you can also launch cloud agents with Grok @Bot btw! \n\nhere's how i'm so productive:\n\n• i built pstack (https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack), my personal set of skills for rigorous engineering and verification. inside of our codebase i call it /lauren-mode, but it's called /poteto-mode in pstack. \n• i use Grok @Bot routines to farm context for me: bug reports on slack, user complaints on X, generating new feature ideas. Grok Bot feeds my \"outer loop\", where i think about what to point my factory at next.\n• i make heavy use of /goal, /loop, and /swarm inside of pstack to run my Full Autopilot playbook, which lets your agents/bots fully own, verify, and ship a task from start to finish. \n• everything runs on cloud agents, so my bots work 24/7 even when i'm asleep or my laptop is offline.","raw_text":{"text":"this is a huge release! i shipped 1000 PRs last month and am on track to doubling that this month, all thanks to cloud agents. you can also launch cloud agents with Grok @Bot btw! \n\nhere's how i'm so productive:\n\n• i built pstack (https://t.co/u9xIlN3eN0), my personal set of skills for rigorous engineering and verification. inside of our codebase i call it /lauren-mode, but it's called /poteto-mode in pstack. \n• i use Grok @Bot routines to farm context for me: bug reports on slack, user complaints on X, generating new feature ideas. Grok Bot feeds my \"outer loop\", where i think about what to point my factory at next.\n• i make heavy use of /goal, /loop, and /swarm inside of pstack to run my Full Autopilot playbook, which lets your agents/bots fully own, verify, and ship a task from start to finish. \n• everything runs on cloud agents, so my bots work 24/7 even when i'm asleep or my laptop is offline.","display_text_range":[0,911],"facets":[{"type":"mention","indices":[170,174],"original":"Bot","id":"2085838061347217408"},{"type":"url","indices":[231,254],"original":"https://t.co/u9xIlN3eN0","replacement":"https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack","display":"github.com/cursor/plugins…"},{"type":"mention","indices":[427,431],"original":"Bot","id":"2085838061347217408"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"poteto","url":"https://x.com/poteto","id":"2832427459","followers":194807,"following":911,"likes":18769,"media_count":491,"name":"lauren","description":"Grok @Bot at @SpaceXSI. Shipping with https://x.ai/bot/plugin/9717366?pstack. React compiler core team, prev cursor, meta, netflix","raw_description":{"text":"Grok @Bot at @SpaceXSI. Shipping with https://t.co/FhHxHHdUAz. React compiler core team, prev cursor, meta, netflix","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[38,61],"original":"https://t.co/FhHxHHdUAz","replacement":"https://x.ai/bot/plugin/9717366?pstack","display":"x.ai/bot/plugin/971…"}]},"location":"OC","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2832427459/1760377968","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2093473719830315008/oo09g1Ov_200x200.jpg","joined":"Fri Sep 26 01:06:36 +0000 2014","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":141,"retweets":58,"likes":1609,"bookmarks":1427,"quotes":27,"created_at":"Wed Aug 19 18:20:49 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1787163649,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":179083,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"quote":{"url":"https://x.com/cursor_ai/status/2090136956101414982","id":"2090136956101414982","text":"We're continuing to improve cloud agents in Cursor.\n\nThey pick up work from events, hold a goal until it's met, and stay on course through long sessions.","raw_text":{"text":"We're continuing to improve cloud agents in Cursor.\